      "title": "Unchecked type assertion in Styler",
      "message": "The Styler runs on every style application and does an unchecked type assertion on r.widget. If any Label node is mounted with a widget that is not *core.Text, this panics. It also re-resolves the style a second time on every style pass, which is redundant work.",
